---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="San Francisco Slip And Fall Attorney | The Sulfab Law Office"
  description="Injured in a slip and fall accident in San Francisco? Sulfab Law Office helps victims of unsafe property conditions recover compensation. Free consultation."
>
  <section class="relative bg-dark pt-28 pb-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <img src="/assets/images/hero-slip-and-fall.webp" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center" loading="eager" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-dark/95 via-dark/80 to-slate-900/60"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-dark/20"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full mb-8"></div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Personal Injury</span>
        <h1 class="text-white text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6">San Francisco Slip and Fall Lawyer</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xl md:text-2xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">A slip and fall can occur in seconds, yet leave lasting damage to the body. If your injury was due to an unsafe condition on another person's premises, you may have legal standing to obtain compensation.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white/25 text-white hover:border-gold hover:bg-white/5 transition-all rounded-lg">Free Case Review</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50/50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">A slip and fall can occur in seconds, yet leave lasting damage to the body. One may face medical expenses, lost wages, discomfort, anxiety, and more from this incident. If your slip and fall injury was due to an unsafe condition on another person's premises, you may have legal standing to obtain compensation.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">At The Sulfab Law Office, our slip and fall lawyer in San Francisco will help you determine your options following a fall. We can look into what occurred, advise you of your legal rights, and guide you in moving forward to get compensation for your damages.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Causes</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">How Slip and Fall Accidents Happen</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Owners of properties and businesses have to make an effort to maintain safety on their properties. They must also give warnings of the dangers on their properties. If they fail to do this, injuries may result.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Wet or slippery surfaces</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Uneven pavements</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Dim lighting</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Loose carpets</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Food or liquid spillage</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Faulty stairs and handrails</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Unorganized or cluttered walkways</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed text-center mt-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">Your slip and fall attorney in San Francisco can look into the cause of the condition that led to your accident. Our team reviews photos, video footage, reports from inspections, and other types of evidence.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Common Injuries</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Injuries After a Slip and Fall</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">An accident can lead to more than just a bruise. There are some injuries that will require treatment over time and have an effect on your everyday life.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Bone Fractures</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Fractures from a fall can require surgery, immobilization, and lengthy rehabilitation, affecting mobility and daily life.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Head and Brain Trauma</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Head trauma can cause concussions and traumatic brain injuries with lasting cognitive and physical effects.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Back and Neck Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Falls can cause herniated discs, spinal damage, and chronic pain that impacts work and everyday activities.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Torn and Sprained Ligaments</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ligament injuries can cause instability, swelling, and long-term pain, often requiring physical therapy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all md:col-span-2">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Shoulder, Knee and Ankle Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Joint injuries are common in falls and may require ongoing treatment and affect your ability to work or enjoy daily life. Many injuries may not seem too serious at first glance. You should always see a doctor after an accident and follow their instructions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Legal Process</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Building a Strong Injury Claim</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">It is often necessary for you to prove that an unsafe situation or dangerous condition caused the injury and that the property owner was aware of this risk, or should have been aware of it. This may prove quite challenging without the right kind of evidence.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Our team examines the timing of the hazard, whether there was a report, whether the owner had sufficient time to make repairs or give warning, and whether another individual or entity might be partially responsible.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">The insurance providers will often seek to minimize their payouts. They may argue that you could have been aware of the risk, or that you contributed to the accident. California employs comparative negligence principles, so your proportion of fault affects the payout. An expert slip and fall lawyer in San Francisco will be able to assist you in such a situation.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">We examine photos, video footage, inspection reports, and other evidence to build a strong claim on your behalf.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Financial Recovery</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Compensation You May Seek</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Whether your situation qualifies for compensation depends on the facts of your case. You may be able to recover compensation for losses related to your injuries, including but not limited to:</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Medical Expenses</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Coverage for emergency care, ongoing treatment, and rehabilitation costs related to the accident.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Wages & Earning Capacity</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Compensation for wages lost and diminished earning capacity due to your injuries.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Pain & Suffering</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Recovery for pain, suffering, rehabilitation costs, and all other losses that result from the accident.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">FAQ</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">What should I do after a slip and fall?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Seek treatment, report the incident, take photographs of the hazardous condition and any injuries you have sustained, gather the information of any witnesses, and keep the shoes and clothing worn during the accident.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">How do I prove the property owner was responsible?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">You may need to show that the owner caused the hazard, knew about it or should have found it. Photos, videos, records and witness statements can help your case.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Can I get compensation if I was partly at fault?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes. In California, comparative negligence rules apply. This means that even though you might have contributed to your own injury, there is a possibility that you will still receive compensation. The compensation will only be decreased in accordance with your degree of fault.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">What can a slip and fall lawyer in San Francisco do for my case?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">A slip and fall lawyer in San Francisco can go through your case details, collect evidence, identify who may be responsible and explain what legal actions you might take. In addition, a professional lawyer will advise you on the amount of compensation for medical treatment and other expenses.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-dark border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4 italic font-serif">Discuss Your Slip and Fall Case With The Sulfab Law Office</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">If you were hurt because of an unsafe property condition, you do not have to handle the process alone. We can review your situation and explain your options during a free case review. We provide clear answers and practical guidance from the start.</p>
      <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
